      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 WORKFLOW LOGIC\n\n**STEP 1:** Check comments every 5 min\n**STEP 2:** Match keywords from Sheets\n**STEP 3:** Reply to comment\n**STEP 4:** Check if user is ALREADY following\n\n**IF ALREADY FOLLOWING:**\n→ Send link directly ✅\n\n**IF NOT FOLLOWING:**\n→ Send DM with 2 buttons:\n   • Visit Profile (opens IG profile)\n   • I'm Following ✓ (button to click)\n\n**STEP 5:** User clicks \"I'm Following\"\n**STEP 6:** Re-check if they followed\n\n**IF FOLLOWED:**\n→ Send main link 🎉\n\n**IF NOT:**\n→ Send reminder to follow",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 380
      },
