        "content": "## 📊 GOOGLE SHEETS FORMAT\n\n| Column A | Column B | Column C | Column D | Column E |\n|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Instagram URL | Title | Keyword | Reply Message | DM Message |\n| https://instagram.com/p/abc | Contest | WIN | Check DM! 🎁 | Get prize: bit.ly/win |\n\n**Row 1 = Headers**\n**Row 2+ = Data**",
